# Personal-only local runtime (K2 + bundled llama.cpp) â€” not for other devices
#
# The K2 weights and llama-server binaries are BUILT LOCALLY and must never
# reach the repo. Both the Android assets tree and any staged desktop payload
# are covered here. GitHub ships the public variant, which carries neither and
# instead suggests the user download K2.
core/k2_server.py
.venv/llama.cpp/

# Staged personal K2 payloads â€” model + llama-server for any target.
# Paths are anchored so nothing under these trees can be committed by accident.
**/assets/k2/
**/k2/llama-server
**/k2/llama-server.exe
**/k2/*.gguf
k2/
# Cross-compiled fork checkouts and outputs from the K2 runtime build.
llama-k2/

